		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5172&amp;p=37450#p37450"><![CDATA[
No, you can't listen to both timeslots at the same time. <br><br>You can enable both timeslots by turning off the TS Filter, you will then hear the first one to become active but while you are listening to that one you will not hear any activity on the second one. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Mon Jun 09, 2025 11:42 am</p><hr />
